      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hi, I'm having trouble reproducing this. A few questions --\n\n1. Do you have an active VRC+ subscription on a separate account?\n\n2. Could you possibly provide logs for a session where this occurred? Logs are stored as text files in the directory AppData\\LocalLow\\VRChat\\VRChat.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
