  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-04-05T14:29:27.490Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hey, just wanted to flag a pretty serious issue I ran into with the VRC+ subscription system.\n\nIf you go to the VRC+ page and hit “Renew,” but don’t actually go through with any payment — just leave it sitting there for a few minutes — the subscription still gets activated without charging anything. The subscription only lasts about 2-3 days, I tested this a couple of times, and each time it gave me access to VRC+ without ever taking me through a payment screen or charging my account.\n\nIt looks like something’s getting triggered server-side after a delay, even without payment confirmation. Not sure if it’s a timeout or some kind of fallback logic, but yeah… definitely a loophole someone could abuse to get VRC+ for free.",
